                        8620 --3257:  * \par Precondition
                        8621 --3258:  *  - None
                        8622 --3259:  * \par Detailed description
                        8623 --3260:  *      - Make sure the argument is not NULL.
                        8624 --3261:  *      - Call #r_pkcl_rsa_chk_pkc_data to check the argument p_sign.
                        8625 --3262:  *      - Call #r_pkcl_rsa_chk_hash_type to check the message digest hash type.
                        8626 --3263:  *      - Call #r_pkcl_rsa_chk_mask_option to check the RSA mask option of p_ctx->p_mask_option.
                        8627 --3264:  *      - Call #r_pkcl_rsa_chk_salt to check the salt length of p_ctx->p_mask_option->salt_len.
                        8628 --3265:  * \par Remarks
                        8629 --3266:  *  - None
                        8630 --3267:  *
                        8631 --3268:  * Pseudo-code for the function can be found below.
                        8632 --3269:  *  -# Initialize the variable ret with #PKCL_RET_INTERNALERR.
